{"id":"das-verschwinden-des-josef-mengele-tmdb-1037264","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Das Verschwinden des Josef Mengele","overview":"Tras la Segunda Guerra Mundial, Josef Mengele, el médico nazi de Auschwitz, escapa a Sudamérica para rehacer su vida en la clandestinidad. A través de los ojos de su hijo, que lo reencuentra, Mengele se enfrenta a un pasado que ya no puede ignorar. De Buenos Aires a Paraguay, pasando por Brasil, el hombre que llegó a ser conocido como 'El Ángel de la muerte' organizará su metódica desaparición para evitar cualquier tipo de juicio.","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpSzpfPdhpil5oviHVBk7zLU6EK.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yjN54IGBAkQSr55ntraLdxBoJwr.jpg","genres":["Historia","Drama"],"originalLanguage":"de","spokenLanguages":["Portuguese","Spanish","German","Hungarian"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yjN54IGBAkQSr55ntraLdxBoJwr.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ut976a2NX3mfvQxcN8aSvyQy7Vn.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9Eh7ajfQWv3KTk0ynr99Layg30B.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/dcVIKZD8vzvoNvp7ZUtRgafHYNc.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jFqWAeatPLvGfhd6gAeIOf3dcDJ.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":6.6},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"August Diehl","role":"Josef Mengele","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZfdH3EXLr5OmXBtxV1zT8eYbpT.jpg","personTmdbId":6091,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Max Bretschneider","role":"Rolf Mengele","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCYgQzwOkpZD7FiOfmH3mzmiIF1.jpg","personTmdbId":1651411,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"David Ruland","role":"Hans Sedlmeier","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Lsarn2jgKIiEUrLVBHf9eaeWfi.jpg","personTmdbId":1919367,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Dana Herfurth","role":"Irene Mengele","photoUrl":"https://ima